          "date": "2026-10-21 20:47:27.000000000",
          "tz": -300
        },
        "subject": "LU-9680 utils: count free buffer space down in value list",
        "message": "LU-9680 utils: count free buffer space down in value list\n\nyaml_parse_value_list() writes each YAML value into the parse buffer\nand adds its length to the free space count. The count must go down.\nAfter each value the count is too large by twice that length. The\nsnprintf() bound then lets writes past data->end.\n\nSubtract the length of each value from the free space count. The\nunwind label moves data->buffer back, so add that length back.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-lnet\nFixes: 3c39dac19aaf (\"LU-9680 utils: add netlink infrastructure\")\nSigned-off-by: Chris Horn <chorn@ddn.com>\nAssisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5\nChange-Id: I635761fa79c530bf6616db86efb94c42b930615e\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
